        "content": "### {{CLINIC_NAME}} - Daily Staff Briefing (PET WF11)\n\n**🎯 Purpose:** Automatically prepares and sends daily appointment briefings to staff\n\n**🚀 Trigger:**\n• Daily at {{BRIEFING_TIME}} ({{TIMEZONE}})\n• Customizable cron: {{BRIEFING_CRON_EXPRESSION}}\n\n**📋 Process:**\n1. Fetch today's appointments from Google Calendar\n2. Format briefing with appointment details and times\n3. Send formatted briefing to Slack channel\n\n**📊 Integration:**\n• Google Calendar: {{GOOGLE_CALENDAR_ID}}\n• Slack Channel: {{SLACK_CHANNEL_NAME}} ({{SLACK_CHANNEL_ID}})\n\n**⚙️ Configuration:**\n• Clinic: {{CLINIC_NAME}}\n• Time Zone: {{TIMEZONE}}\n• Briefing Time: {{BRIEFING_TIME}}\n• Auto-sorts appointments by time\n• Handles both timed and all-day events",
